      <!-- ALIGNMENT vs GHYaf3-d1e722 (Oyta abbreviatio). 85 sources -> 64 mapped, 21 dropped.
           Q8 (utrum secundum proportionem caritatis viae succedat proportionaliter magnitudo gloriae).
           A very dense disputation (Wodeham vs a socius over lumen gloriae & simultaneous beatific visions).
           The abbreviatio had packed many source paragraphs into a few giant target paragraphs; those
           targets have now been SPLIT to 1:1 (each new segment keeps the first source's id; later segments
           got new target xml:ids). Mapping by content/order, verified. No folds remain.

           TARGET SPLITS PERFORMED (original target -> resulting target ids = their source):
           * d1e125 -> 125(d110) 140(d123)
           * d1e269 -> 269(d292) 285(d305)
           * d1e302 -> 302(d423) 400(d500); d500 also spans 417
           * d1e465 -> 465(d624) 480(d649); d649 also spans 498,510
           * d1e510 -> 510(d649) 525(d694)
           * d1e543 -> 543(d711) 600(d819)
           * d1e650 -> 650(d837) 660(d854) 665(d878, its concluding clause)
           * d1e874 -> 874(d1105) 885(d1124) 895(d1161); d1105 also spans 863; d1161 also spans 907
           * d1e962 -> 962(d1191) 968(d1251); d1191 also spans 918; d1251 also spans 974
           * d1e1141 -> 1141(d1390) 1150(d1405) 1160(d1416)
           * d1e1174 -> 1174(d1444) 1185(d1461)
           * d1e1205 -> 1205(d1480) 1215(d1492); d1492 also spans 1226
           * d1e1269 -> 1269(d1984) 1277(d2031)
           * d1e1308 -> 1308(d2069) 1318(d2083) 1325(d2091) 1332(d2108)
           * d1e1355 -> 1355(d2139) 1370(d2233) 1385(d2239) 1400(d2309); d2309 also spans 1494
           * d1e1494 -> 1494(d2309) 1505(d2353)
           * d1e1520 -> 1520(d2398) 1535(d2410)

           OTHER MULTI-TARGET single sources (one src spans >1 target, no split needed): d241->239,250;
           d988->734,758,774; d1283->1001,1008; d1331->1058,1076,1090.

           NB target d1e850 ('Beatus igitur augustinus negat nos in patria habituros volibiles
           cogitationes...') = source d1095 (per JW). The whole 5o/6o/7o forma-creaturae/volubiles block
           (d1544-d1912, incl. d1834) is dropped.
           *** REVIEW NEEDED: the d1e850 <- d1095 alignment fits sequentially (right position in the
           argument order) but the conceptual overlap is NOT obvious; verify the content match. ***

           TARGET-ONLY (Oyta additions, no Wodeham source): d1e700 ('Secunda quam tenet Adam...' summary of
           the two opinions), d1e1099 ('Nota etiam quod... unica visione...').

           DROPPED (21): d339 d386 (Wodeham 'calumpnia in materia non forma' rebuttal) d589 (2o arguo)
           d868 d935 d948 d962 (habitus-lumen objections; d868 'Et istud confirmatur per primum argumentum')
           d1544 d1563 d1577 d1623 d1648 d1674 d1694 d1723 d1759 d1807 d1834 d1912 (5o-7o
           forma-creaturae/volubiles block) d2474 (ad 5m) d2575 (3us subart.). -->
